sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cron as IngestionScheduler
    participant Cycle as RunIngestionCycleService
    participant APIClient as WeatherStationCatalog
    participant API as API service
    participant OWM as WeatherDataProvider / OWM

    Cron->>Cycle: execute("scheduled")
    Cycle->>APIClient: listOpenWeatherStations()
    APIClient->>API: GET /internal/ingestion/stations<br/>x-ingestion-token
    API-->>APIClient: provider=openweather stations
    APIClient-->>Cycle: IngestionStation[]

    loop Active stations, bounded concurrency
        Cycle->>OWM: getCurrentWeather(location)
        alt Provider success
            OWM-->>Cycle: normalized reading
        else Provider failure
            OWM--xCycle: typed error
            Note over Cycle: Failure is recorded;<br/>the batch continues
        end
    end

    Note over Cycle: Inactive stations are skipped
    Cycle-->>Cron: structured cycle summary
